/div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"77669827\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch High Quality Multistage Submersible Pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231656349984843.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>4 Inch High Quality Multistage Submersible Pump is a direct mounted pump combining the motor and pump‘together. It can be used as water suction equipment for groundwater, river, reservoir and canal etc.This pump is mainly used for agriculture irrigation, water supply for human and animal in plateau and mountain area, and water drainage in city, factories, railway system, mining area and construction site etc.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p><strong>Model</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p><strong>Motor power (kw)</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p><strong>Motor power (hp)</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p><strong>Outlet</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p><strong>Capacity</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p>4SP8</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p>0.75-7.5kw</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p>1-10hp</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p>G1.5~2&amp;rdquo;</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p>0-14.5 m³/h</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p><strong>Head</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p><strong>Length</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p><strong>Phase</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p><strong>Max. Dia.</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p><strong>Q. max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p>10-264 m</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p>631-2274mm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Single phase/ Three phase</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p>98mm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p>14.5 m³/h</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p><strong>Driver</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p><strong>Working Principle</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Impeller material</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p><strong>Shaft seal   type</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p><strong>Temperature</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Motor engine</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Centrifugal</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Stainless steel</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p>mechanical seal</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p>&lt;35℃</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231658241951980.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231656308581768.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong> 3.Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231659199678886.jpg\"/></td><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231659275555498.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231659362119140.jpg\"/></td><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231659476956667.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231659589820845.jpg\"/></td><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><img alt=\"image021(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231700098229599.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231700202938059.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image023(001).jpg\"/><img alt=\"image025(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231700292387431.jpg\"/></p></td><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><img alt=\"image027(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231700451884759.jpg\"/></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>1.Ground water suction equipment</p><p>2.Water lifting in rivers, reservoirs and Canals</p><p>3.Agriculture irrigation</p><p>4.Water supply for human and animal in plateau and mountain area</p><p>5.Water drainage in city, factories, railway system, mining area and construction site</p><p>6.Water supply equipment in any possible places</p><p><strong>5. Using Conditions</strong></p><p>1. 380V voltage deviation is no more than ±5%,frequency is 50HZ, three -phase power deviation is no more than ±1%.</p><p>2. Motor cavity must be filled with water.</p><p>3. The first stage impeller of the pump should be more than 2mm below the moving water surface,  pump unit should be less than 70m below the static water level.</p><p>4. The distance from the motor bottom to well bottom must be more than 3m.</p><p>5. Water temperature should be no more than 35°C.</p><p>6. Sand content of the water ( by mass) should be no more than 0.01%.</p><p>7. PH value of water 6.5-8.5.</p><p>8. Hydrogen sulfide content of the water should be no more 